              "text": "deduzir — \"to deduce; to deduct\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pelas malas, deduzi que eles iam viajar. From the suitcases, I deduced that they were going to travel."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Conjugated like conduzir: deduzo, deduzes, deduz. Also to deduct a sum."
            }
          ]
        },
